label avoid
cable: Green! Tell me if you can hear me!
diode: Give it some space, Cable. We know you're worried.
cable: Of course I'm worried! Green's shut down worse and no one told us for two hours!
siren: How are you feeling, Green?
green: ...
green: I'm fine.
cable: No you're not. Try again.
green: Okay I'm not fine. Is that what you wanted to hear?
green: I'm getting the feeling that the other magnet bots are just tolerating me. I know Siren said the most important robots are the ones we have in common with. Because it's easier to understand.
jump final
[end_timeline]
label yay
cable: Green! Tell me if you can hear me!
diode: Give it some space, Cable. We know you're worried.
green: I don't know if I can do this again.
siren: Do what?
green: Everything? I don't know.
label final
diode: We've been talking for a while. And we think you need a change of pace.
cable: I'm taking you to a different floor. Show you what else is out there.
green: Wait why?
siren: You don't know much about Hijo, or what we used to be. Granted, I don't know that much either.
green: I thought we're recycling bots?
siren: That's a job we happened to be good at. But no.
cable: So what do you think?
[signal arg="final"]
[end_timeline]